Modern Greek text corpora (monotonic next-word model and word list)
------------------------------------------------------------------

The monotonic Modern Greek next-word model and word list are derived from the
openly licensed corpora below. Each is pinned (revision, size, sha256) in
data/el_lm_corpora.json, which also records the excluded corpora and why;
extract_el_monotonic_lm.py refuses NonCommercial and NoDerivatives licenses.
"Derived" means n-gram and word counts computed from normalized, tokenized
sentences. The keyboard bundle distributes counts rather than sentences.
For reproducible builds, data/el_lm_inputs/ on the public ciscoriordan/dilemma
Hub repository also preserves the original Tatoeba export and unmodified
Wiktionary usage examples under their source licenses below. Its provenance.json
records attribution, original source pins and checksums; document ids and groups
are preserved. Those archived source documents are separate from the bundle.

- Greek Parliament Proceedings 1989-2020 (tell_all.csv), Konstantina Dritsa,
